{"id":8834727805127,"title":"Christmas Cardinal Perched on Branch Within Wreath Patchwork Winter Quilt","handle":"christmas-cardinal-perched-on-branch-within-wreath-patchwork-winter-quilt-9e7c0b5896-9e7c0b5896","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the warmth of the holiday season with this customizable Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully printed winter design of a realistic cardinal perched on a branch within a pine wreath, this cozy bedding layer brings a festive touch of nature to your bedroom, guest room, or vacation home. Perfect for Christmas gifting or everyday winter comfort, you can easily personalize it to create a thoughtful keepsake for bird lovers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features options to add custom text or your name to the quilt for a unique, personalized touch.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Comfort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a soft, breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth and comfort in all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOptional Pillowcases:\u003c\/strong\u003e Complete your bedding set by choosing to add matching printed pillowcases in your preferred quantity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Highly functional design can be used as a bed quilt, a cozy throw blanket, a picnic mat, or a comfortable companion for camping trips.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and quick-drying, allowing it to easily fluff back up to its cozy state.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/t